      "step_1": "If Alice wants to send a secure message to Bob, she uses Bob's public key to lock the message in a special envelope and put it in his mailbox.",
      "step_2": "Only Bob can open the envelope and read the message because he is the only one with the private key.",
      "step_3": "Even if someone else sees the message in the mailbox, they can't open it because they don't have the private key."
    }
